702
00:27:34,820 --> 00:27:36,957
- Oh no.
- It'll happen.

703
00:27:36,990 --> 00:27:40,427
Oh, poor guy.

704
00:27:40,460 --> 00:27:45,398
Oh, the great George Worthing
Yates wrote the screenplay.

705
00:27:48,868 --> 00:27:52,405
(robot mimics music)

706
00:27:52,438 --> 00:27:55,908
Oh look, Paul Westerberg is
the film editor up there.

707
00:27:55,942 --> 00:27:58,945
Neat little flower. Pretty.

708
00:27:59,778 --> 00:28:01,080
That's gotta be it
for the credits.

709
00:28:01,113 --> 00:28:02,348
- Yeah, that's about it.
- Let's get to the movie.

710
00:28:02,382 --> 00:28:04,717
(all gasp)
My heart.

711
00:28:04,750 --> 00:28:05,918
Should've seen
that one coming.

712
00:28:05,952 --> 00:28:08,588
Hey, look out for
the dip in the road.

713
00:28:08,622 --> 00:28:10,257
Whoo.

714
00:28:11,825 --> 00:28:13,460
Oh, now they
