735
00:29:00,307 --> 00:29:02,008
And I talk hard and fast.

736
00:29:02,042 --> 00:29:02,975
Swanson.

737
00:29:03,008 --> 00:29:04,310
No, actually it's Steinbeck.

738
00:29:04,343 --> 00:29:05,878
I was up in Salinas
