1849
01:11:55,178 --> 01:11:57,013
Screen going to be all
right outside, doctor?

1850
01:11:57,047 --> 01:11:59,717
His mouthwash
just ain't makin' it.

1851
01:11:59,750 --> 01:12:00,850
Yes, that's fine.

1852
01:12:00,883 --> 01:12:04,455
Glenn, this is a film about
V.D., watch it carefully.

1853
01:12:04,488 --> 01:12:08,692
Well, fellas, take your time
