1854
01:12:08,725 --> 01:12:10,693
Hey, hey, hey, we're
shootin' a movie here.

1855
01:12:10,727 --> 01:12:13,263
Hey, get off the set.

1856
01:12:13,297 --> 01:12:15,565
Oh, you belong there.

1857
01:12:18,668 --> 01:12:22,973
Will our first
contestant please come down?

1858
01:12:23,007 --> 01:12:25,042
We gotta go.

1859
01:12:25,075 --> 01:12:27,778
See ya. It's been
nice talkin' to ya.

1860
01:12:27,812 --> 01:12:31,282
See ya later, Glenn. Bye.

1861
01:12:31,315 --> 01:12:36,520
