1874
01:13:07,583 --> 01:13:09,887
Thanks to the
Miracle Acrylic Dome.

1875
01:13:09,920 --> 01:13:11,888
All right. Let's work it now.

1876
01:13:11,922 --> 01:13:13,623
Future date: 2213.

1877
01:13:13,657 --> 01:13:16,227
Ktla predicts Alan Alda
revealed as anti-Christ,

1878
01:13:16,260 --> 01:13:17,427
and you are there.

1879
01:13:17,460 --> 01:13:18,828
Plus these extras:

1880
01:13:18,862 --> 01:13:20,330
Pope becomes grandmother.

1881
01:13:20,363 --> 01:13:23,800
Earl Scheib unable to
paint any car for 1995.

1882
01:13:23,833 --> 01:13:25,602
And the average
American will consume

1883
01:13:25,635 --> 01:13:27,537
15 times their weight in snow.

1884
01:13:27,570 --> 01:13:29,840
Wow. Take me to the bridge.

1885
01:13:29,873 --> 01:13:31,642
Future date: 2525.

1886
01:13:31,675 --> 01:13:35,178
Ktla predicts if man is still
alive, if women can survive,

1887
01:13:35,212 --> 01:13:38,748
they will find a stamp made
